License decision deferred
=========================

No software license has been selected for this repository. This file records
the pending decision and does not grant a software license.

Phase 0 contains original Python/Lua source and generated symbolic music data.
It bundles no REAPER or Vital binaries, source, presets, samples, model weights,
or other third-party assets. REAPER and any installed user plugins remain
separate, user-supplied applications with their own terms.

Rationale: the intended desktop audio integration and future dependencies are
not settled. Maintainers should inventory actual distributed dependencies and
assets, review their terms and any linking/distribution requirements, and then
make an explicit project license decision. Choosing a permissive or copyleft
license now without that review would pre-empt that decision.

This pending decision does not prevent development of the authorized Phase 0
implementation. Public reuse/distribution licensing remains a maintainer task.
